      "q": "How much federal contract money goes to Utah?",
      "a": "Utah receives $5.1B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The state recorded $4B in FY21, $5.3B in FY22, $6.3B in FY23, $7.2B in FY24, $5.2B in FY25, and $5.1B in FY26 to date. Current-year totals are partial because the fiscal year is still in progress."
